{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-explainer-about-hobbies-daily-talk-japan-europe-usa-short-words/audio/main-3152d14543d2.mp3","durationSec":158.784,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.72,"text":"Daily conversation is easy talk at work or home."},{"start":3.46,"end":5.88,"text":"What people talk about in daily life is hobbies."},{"start":6.82,"end":8.62,"text":"Small talk is short, polite talk."},{"start":9.2,"end":10.42,"text":"It helps people feel at ease."},{"start":11.06,"end":14.78,"text":"Safe topics include weather, food, sports, and hobbies."},{"start":14.78,"end":17.24,"text":"Weekend plans are also easy to share."},{"start":18,"end":20.82,"text":"Bronislaw Malinowski wrote about this kind of talk in 1923."},{"start":21.7,"end":23.34,"text":"He said it helps people stay friendly."},{"start":23.88,"end":27.86,"text":"We can notice three things: the topic, the time, and the friendly reason."},{"start":29.04,"end":31.6,"text":"NPB is Japan's top baseball league."},{"start":32.22,"end":33.34,"text":"It has 12 teams."},{"start":33.98,"end":36.34,"text":"People often talk about a weekend NPB game."},{"start":37.04,"end":41.52,"text":"Ichiro Suzuki set a record of 262 hits in 2004."},{"start":42.38,"end":44.54,"text":"A great player can give fans a fun topic."},{"start":45.38,"end":46.86,"text":"Karaoke is another common hobby."},{"start":46.86,"end":50.14,"text":"Friends often rent a small karaoke box by the hour."},{"start":50.58,"end":52.8,"text":"They can sing together after work or on a weekend."},{"start":53.44,"end":55.74,"text":"A weekend trip can also become a talk topic."},{"start":55.74,"end":58.3,"text":"Ueno Park has over 1,000 cherry trees."},{"start":58.88,"end":61.62,"text":"The trees bloom in late March and early April."},{"start":62.26,"end":63.6,"text":"People have a picnic under them."},{"start":64.06,"end":65.68,"text":"This picnic is called hanami."},{"start":66.58,"end":68.78,"text":"Hot springs give people another trip idea."},{"start":69.56,"end":71.44,"text":"Dogo Onsen is one of the oldest onsen."},{"start":72.06,"end":72.98,"text":"It is in Matsuyama."},{"start":73.62,"end":76.46,"text":"After the trip, people can share what they saw and did."},{"start":76.46,"end":79.44,"text":"Football gives many people a shared topic."},{"start":80.28,"end":82.48,"text":"The Bundesliga began in 1963."},{"start":83.32,"end":85.78,"text":"Monday talk can follow a weekend match."},{"start":85.78,"end":88.96,"text":"FC Bayern Munich has 31 league titles."},{"start":89.8,"end":92.74,"text":"In Spain, cafe talk often follows a big game."},{"start":93.58,"end":95.88,"text":"El Clasico is a famous football match."},{"start":96.66,"end":99.34,"text":"Lionel Messi scored 26 goals in this match."},{"start":100.02,"end":104.1,"text":"Like baseball talk in Japan, football talk can make Monday chat easy."},{"start":105,"end":107.34,"text":"Outdoor hobbies can give people new stories."},{"start":108.48,"end":112.94,"text":"Switzerland has more than 65,000 kilometres of marked hiking trails."},{"start":113.46,"end":116,"text":"About 2.7 million people there hike often."},{"start":116.78,"end":119.02,"text":"Yellow Wanderweg signs show walking time."},{"start":119.7,"end":120.94,"text":"Many trails go through the Alps."},{"start":121.76,"end":123.76,"text":"A Sunday hike can become a Monday story."},{"start":124.56,"end":127.52,"text":"In Japan, a weekend onsen trip can do the same job."},{"start":127.98,"end":130.8,"text":"The place is different, but the friendly reason is the same."},{"start":131.52,"end":134.14,"text":"In the USA, many people watch American football."},{"start":135.16,"end":136.84,"text":"The NFL has 32 teams."},{"start":137.58,"end":139.9,"text":"Thanksgiving is on the fourth Thursday of November."},{"start":139.9,"end":143,"text":"Families often watch NFL games that weekend."},{"start":143,"end":146.28,"text":"The Super Bowl is the last pro football game of the year."},{"start":146.9,"end":151.38,"text":"A listed TV record for it is 127.7 million viewers."},{"start":152.22,"end":155.72,"text":"These events give many people the same topic at the same time."},{"start":155.72,"end":158.3,"text":"Shared time makes small talk easier."}],"words":[{"text":"Daily","start":0,"end":0.26},{"text":"conversation","start":0.26,"end":0.8},{"text":"is","start":0.8,"end":1.2},{"text":"easy","start":1.2,"end":1.58},{"text":"talk","start":1.58,"end":1.86},{"text":"at","start":1.86,"end":2.02},{"text":"work","start":2.02,"end":2.26},{"text":"or","start":2.26,"end":2.4},{"text":"home","start":2.4,"end":2.72},{"text":"What","start":3.46,"end":3.52},{"text":"people","start":3.52,"end":3.76},{"text":"talk","start":3.76,"end":4.04},{"text":"about","start":4.04,"end":4.24},{"text":"in","start":4.24,"end":4.4},{"text":"daily","start":4.4,"end":4.64},{"text":"life","start":4.64,"end":5.06},{"text":"is","start":5.06,"end":5.5},{"text":"hobbies","start":5.5,"end":5.88},{"text":"Small","start":6.82,"end":6.84},{"text":"talk","start":6.84,"end":7.04},{"text":"is","start":7.04,"end":7.22},{"text":"short","start":7.22,"end":7.6},{"text":"polite","start":7.88,"end":8.2},{"text":"talk","start":8.2,"end":8.62},{"text":"It","start":9.2,"end":9.26},{"text":"helps","start":9.26,"end":9.42},{"text":"people","start":9.42,"end":9.72},{"text":"feel","start":9.72,"end":9.94},{"text":"at","start":9.94,"end":10.12},{"text":"ease","start":10.12,"end":10.42},{"text":"Safe","start":11.06,"end":11.1},{"text":"topics","start":11.1,"end":11.52},{"text":"include","start":11.52,"end":11.92},{"text":"weather","start":11.92,"end":12.3},{"text":"food","start":12.9,"end":13.26},{"text":"sports","start":13.78,"end":14.18},{"text":"and","start":14.32,"end":14.44},{"text":"hobbies","start":14.44,"end":14.78},{"text":"Weekend","start":14.78,"end":15.72},{"text":"plans","start":15.72,"end":16.04},{"text":"are","start":16.04,"end":16.24},{"text":"also","start":16.24,"end":16.46},{"text":"easy